// SYNTHETIC / ILLUSTRATIVE filament morphology -- NOT experimental Imaris data
// Example generated for explaining ordered chains, branching points, and spatial loops.
// Coordinates are illustrative and have no asserted physical unit.
// Standard NEURON HOC pt3dadd(x,y,z,diam) notation (4 arguments).
// In this example, sections [3] and [4] share BOTH endpoint coordinates.
// This creates a closed loop in a graph formed by merging identical XYZ points.
// NEURON connect topology itself remains tree-shaped; no cyclic connect statements.

